  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a3775f729ea4d808adfa50b29314549, type: 3}
  m_Name: AshenPass
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: HeroesOfMetalAge.Infrastructure::HeroesOfMetalAge.Infrastructure.Content.MissionSettingsScriptableObject
  id: ashen-pass
  displayName: THE ASHEN PASS
  heroId: kael
  description: Across the pass, the Ashen Clan sells steel. Beyond its castle the
    Black Banner holds the gate of fire, and in the burning east a maiden waits in
    chains.
  briefingPages:
  - 'On the first day, our hero collects his friends and like minded folks around
    the land.

    Because at this point, he is looking for success in an external
    world, the overworld of humans.'
  - He will search for the Secret of Metal in riches, women and victory. He needs
    to penetrate through the tight passage of Psur to the east.
  - Beyond the clan's castle the Black Banner holds the gate of fire. In the burning
    east a maiden is chained among horned beasts, and under the mountains something
    old is sleeping.
  clanId: ashen-clan
  clanName: Ashen Clan
  clanHeroName: Lord Varg
